Some things that you did wrong:

You attacked the wiz without having ALL items (except for the book, of
course). You should get candles, candelabrum and bell, then find the
vibrating square, and only then go for the book. Don't wake up the wiz
if not necessary.

Secondly, every time you kill the wiz, you should loot his body. During
a fight, you often don't notice when he steals something (it is on the
message line, but you -more- past it). Thus, check his corpse to se if
he has stolen anything.

He always leaves the things he stole behind, but when you have killed
him several times, as you said, you'l have to go back and check ALL
these corpses. You WILL find the book and bell, eventually. If you
petrified him by fighting him with a cockatrice corpse, you'll need a
pick-axe to remove the book and bell from the statue.

